      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "QoE is a site-window experience score, not a detection verdict and not a customer SLA.\n\n`qoe = 0.45 × (1 − NXDOMAIN ratio) + 0.35 × (site baseline latency p95 / current latency p95) + 0.20 × (1 − saturation)`\n\nLatency better than the site baseline is capped at 1. Without baseline history the latency factor is 1. For Ovnicom replay, latency and saturation are Sentinel enrichment.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Transparent QoE recipe",
      "type": "text"
    },
